Commands under `ledgers parties`

Usage: parties <COMMAND>

Commands:
  balances      parties.balances
  check-vat     parties.check_vat
  create        parties.create
  export        parties.export
  get           parties.get
  import        parties.import
  import-check  parties.import_check
  list          parties.list
  merge         parties.merge
  open-items    parties.open_items
  set-bank      parties.set_bank
  set-logo      parties.set_logo
  update        parties.update
  validate      parties.validate
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
